 experiments included: diagnostic-rerepair, swebench-pertest-data, deepseek-cls-repo, deepseek-cwm-repo, deepseek-traj-repo (NOT COMPLETED), deepseek-traj-repo-s123 (NOT COMPLETED), deepseek-traj-func-v2-fixed (FAILED_TO_RESOLVE), deepseek-traj-func-v2-s123-fixed (FAILED_TO_RESOLVE).\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nEvaluate:\n1. **Methodological soundness** — Are the formulations well-defined? Are comparisons controlled and fair? Is the statistical methodology appropriate?\n2. **Experimental rigor** — Are there enough seeds/runs? Are baselines adequate? Are the missing experiments critical? Is the data leakage concern adequately addressed?\n3. **Results interpretation** — Are claims appropriately scoped? Do the numbers support the claims? Are caveats sufficient?\n4. **Reproducibility** — Is there enough detail to reproduce?\n\nProvide:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted, with severity: minor/moderate/major/critical)\n- Questions for Authors (bulleted)\n- Missing Experiments Assessment: which planned experiments are missing and how much this hurts\n- Score (1-6) with confidence (low/medium/high)\n- Short recommendation sentence\n\nKeep your review under 800 words."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WN76djQWivoqzBArf7qbDa","session_id":"a1d10b2a-da1c-4436-8566-b8bd50259b88","uuid":"bb643a00-0e27-4a6d-b4bf-670e3419372a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:48:12.509Z"}
